0..78 Comment "//! The weakest-precondition observation of state: a handler of state into the"
79..157 Comment "//! predicate transformers `((A, S) => Type, S) => Type`, from a postcondition"
158..238 Comment "//! on the answer and the final state, and an initial state, to the precondition"
239..311 Comment "//! the program needs there [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all], § 3.4,"
312..391 Comment "//! uncurried, with propositions read as types. A scope answers its carrier, so"
392..470 Comment "//! the program it runs ends in the transformers\' unit at its answer, and each"
471..551 Comment "//! clause is its operation\'s image: a read hands the initial state to what runs"
552..628 Comment "//! after, and a store runs what follows from the stored value. The scope is"
629..707 Comment "//! checked as a model of state\'s laws, so the observation identifies what the"
708..783 Comment "//! laws identify, and is a monad morphism from programs over state (§ 4.4"
784..864 Comment "//! derives it from the state algebra at the answer `S => Type`). The normaliser"
865..934 Comment "//! runs no scope yet, so a precondition is computed through the fold"
935..968 Comment "//! `tree-state-wp.gandr` writes."
969..972 Comment "//!"
973..989 Comment "//! - see: #2754"
990..1038 Comment "//! - cites: [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]"
1039..1042 Comment "//!"
1043..1158 Comment "//! [Maillard-2019-dijkstra_monads_all]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3341708 \"Maillard et al., Dijkstra Monads for All\""
1160..1175 Comment "// `StateLaws`."
